  "body_text": "We’re expecting your parcel. We'll be in touch when we have it and it's out for delivery\n\n \n\n \n\n \n\n \n\nWe won't ask you to sign for your parcel, we'll take a photo of it instead in your open doorway as proof it has been delivered.\n\nShow my options\n\nYour parcel: 1550 2652 600 623\n\nChoosing to have your parcel delivered to a DPD Pickup Point, can reduce CO2 emissions per parcel by 63%*\n\n*The 63% saving applies if you collect the parcel on foot or by cycle. We base our CO2 savings on an average calculation (developed with Ecofys - a leading consultancy in energy efficiency) and take into account all stages of the final mile delivery.\n\nNever miss a parcel delivery\n\nDownload the DPD app here for a VIP delivery experience with lots of delivery options to choose from\nGet the app\n\nFind more information about how we process your personal data in our privacy notice.",
